# Copy to .env.local (not committed) and fill in. Also set it in the host's
# environment settings (e.g. Vercel) for the live site.

# Web3Forms access key - sends the project request form straight to your inbox.
# Get one free at https://web3forms.com (enter your email; the key is emailed to you).
# Without it, the form falls back to opening the visitor's email app.
REACT_APP_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
